subject = "Xmip: open-source messaging and integration — project introduction"

# The body and introductions preserve the exact sent wording.
message_template = """\
Hello,\n\n{introduction}\n\nXmip is an open-source messaging and integration \
platform being developed in Rust, with an on-premises-first, cloud-installable \
approach. The project focuses on keeping integration under the organisation’s \
control.\n\nI have prepared two self-guided introductions for technology \
leaders, developers and operators. They cover the project’s architecture and \
direction, including TOML configuration, VS Code tooling, phone-based operations \
and cross-platform working.\n\nVideo — approximately 11 \
minutes:\nhttps://media.githubusercontent.com/media/IlleNilsson/Xmip/2b6f47190aa\
13aed305220592c81829869f846a5/asset/brand/presentation/Xmip-overview.mp4\n\nPowe\
rPoint — 28 slides:\nhttps://media.githubusercontent.com/media/IlleNilsson/Xmip/\
2b6f47190aa13aed305220592c81829869f846a5/asset/brand/presentation/Xmip-overview.\
pptx\n\nProject and source:\nhttps://github.com/IlleNilsson/Xmip\n\nI would \
welcome feedback on the approach and the requirements that matter to your \
organisation. Could you share this with the appropriate architecture, \
integration or open-source team, or let me know whom I should contact?\n\nKind \
regards,\nIlian Nilsson"""

